			"notes": "- potion duration has been halved (short: 45s; long: 90s)\n- potion durations are now configurable\n- the effect radius can now be specified for every block separately\n- fixed an issue that caused some user specified blocks to not load properly (due to mod load order)\n- performance improvements\n\n<details>\n<summary>\nNew default effect radii for ores:<br>\nNote: you probably need to reset the old config\n</summary>\n- Coal Ore: 16<br>\n- Iron Ore: 8<br>\n- Copper Ore: 12<br>\n- Gold Ore: 8<br>\n- Diamond Ore: 5<br>\n- Emerald Ore: 7<br>\n- Lapis Ore: 8<br>\n- Redstone Ore: 8<br>\n- Quartz Ore: 14\n</details>"
